Lemma 25: f(X, f(X, X)) = f(Y, Y).
Proof:
  f(X, f(X, X))
= { by lemma 24 R->L }
  f(X, f(f(X, X), X))
= { by lemma 22 R->L }
  f(X, f(f(X, X), f(X, X)))
= { by lemma 24 R->L }
